#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:252
#, draft
msgid ""
"A URL field on each document leading back to the application here, created in Paperless if missing. Leave blank for none."
msgstr ""
"URL-mező minden dokumentumon, amely visszavezet az itteni jelentkezéshez; a Paperless alkalmazásban létrejön, ha hiányzik. Hagyd üresen, ha nem kell."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:232
#, draft
msgid "API token"
msgstr "API-token"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:247
#, draft
msgid "Custom field for the application's link"
msgstr "Egyéni mező a jelentkezés hivatkozásához"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:235
#, draft
msgid "From your Paperless profile. Stored encrypted; never shown again."
msgstr "A Paperless-profilodból. Titkosítva tárolva; soha többé nem jelenik meg."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:282
msgid "Give the whole address, beginning with https://."
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:226
#, draft
msgid "Paperless address"
msgstr "Paperless-cím"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:180
#, draft
msgid "Paperless consumed the document but gave no id."
msgstr "A Paperless feldolgozta a dokumentumot, de nem adott azonosítót."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:189
#, python-format, draft
msgid "Paperless could not consume the document: %(reason)s"
msgstr "A Paperless nem tudta feldolgozni a dokumentumot: %(reason)s"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:194
#, draft
msgid "Paperless is still consuming the document; it will be checked again."
msgstr "A Paperless még dolgozza fel a dokumentumot; újra ellenőrizzük."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:220
#, draft
msgid "Paperless-ngx"
msgstr "Paperless-ngx"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:243
#, draft
msgid "Put on every document that came from Postulo. Leave blank for none."
msgstr ""
"Minden dokumentumra rákerül, amely a Postulo alkalmazásból érkezett. Hagyd üresen, ha nem kell."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:308
#, python-format, draft
msgid "Reachable. The archive holds %(count)d documents."
msgstr "Elérhető. Az archívum %(count)d dokumentumot tartalmaz."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:239
#, draft
msgid "Tag"
msgstr "Címke"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:291
msgid ""
"This would send your API token unencrypted to a server on the internet, where anything along the way can read it. Use https://."
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py:228
#, draft
msgid "Where you open Paperless, e.g. https://paperless.example.org."
msgstr ""
"Ahol a Paperless alkalmazást megnyitod, pl. https://paperless.example.org."
